course: dictionary
lesson: 12730
title: Dreamless
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Dreamless is built from two parts: dream and less. The ending -less means without, so dreamless means without dreams. «Tom slept all night and had no dreams at all.» Tom had a dreamless night.
explain: The word has a second meaning, about sleep. A dreamless sleep is very deep and peaceful. «After the long hike, Ava fell into a dreamless sleep.» Ava was tired, and the words after the long hike are the clue that her sleep was deep and calm.
explain: When you meet dreamless, swap your meaning into the sentence. Try «After the long hike, Ava fell into a sleep without dreams.» It still makes sense, so you have chosen the right meaning.
fact: Dreamless means without dreams.
fact: The ending -less means without, as in hopeless and careless.
fact: «Dreamless» can also describe sleep that is very deep and peaceful.
fact: In stories, «a dreamless sleep» often shows that someone is worn out and nothing disturbs them.
fact: When you are not sure of a word, look for clues in the words around it, then check by swapping in your meaning.
exercise: «After the long day, Leo fell into a dreamless sleep.» What does dreamless mean here? | Full of scary dreams | *Very deep and peaceful | Wide awake and restless | Noisy and loud
exercise: The word dreamless is made of two parts: dream and less. What does -less mean? | *Without | Very big | Full of | Again
exercise: «Ella slept a dreamless sleep, calm and still, and woke at seven.» Which words show that the sleep was peaceful? | woke at seven | dreamless sleep | *calm and still | slept a
test: «Mum says she had a dreamless night and felt fine in the morning.» What does dreamless mean? | Cold and wet | *Without dreams | Very noisy and busy | Scary and dark
test: In «a dreamless sleep», which word has almost the same meaning as dreamless in its second sense? | short | noisy | *peaceful | tired
exam: «The cat curled up on the rug and fell into a dreamless sleep.» What is the best meaning of dreamless here? | Full of frightening dreams | Lost in the woods | *Very deep and peaceful | Hungry and awake
